{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"大般涅槃經迦葉品校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"一.是書無異譯對勘．但有刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"二.刻校用南宋刻爲底本.另以三本對勘。（一）日本宮內省圖書寮藏東禪寺本.校","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"註略稱北宋刻。（二）日本增上寺藏高麗再雕本.略稱麗刻。（三）西藏重譯大般","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"涅槃經所據舊宋本．略稱藏本。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"三.刻校凡有二例。（一）以北宋刻麗刻對勘底本.改訂文字.附註曰.原刻雲雲.依某","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"刻雲雲。（二）諸本對勘有疑義時則就正藏本.附註曰.依藏本及某刻雲雲。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"四.校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"（一）本書南北宋刻及麗刻.悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"本之校註。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"（二）西藏重譯大般涅槃經．h!phags-payon%s-sumya-n%an-lash!das-pachen-poh!i","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_58_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_58","text":"mdo．〈卷四十三至五十迦葉問品〉奈旦版甘珠．涅槃部kha字函.二八五頁下至四一八頁下。","sortOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}